.TP
.B cppkg\-cli verify
Verify installed packages checksums against lockfile
.RS
Options:
.TP
.B \-\-fix
Re\-download packages that fail checksum verification
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output result as JSON
.RE
.TP
.B cppkg\-cli why
Show which dependency (or dependencies) require the specified package
.RS
Arguments:
.TP
.I package
Required. Package name or repository URL to trace
.RE
.RS
Options:
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output result as JSON
.RE
.RS
Examples:
.IP
.B cppkg\-cli why fmt
.IP
.B cppkg\-cli why nlohmann/json
.RE
